      "lq.hint": "Drag the Moon or the sunlight arrows, and use the slider under the Moon's picture for its phase. Hold Shift while dragging to snap to the eight main positions; the arrow keys nudge whatever you touched last.",
      "lq.qSun": "Where is the Sun?", "lq.qMoon": "Where is the Moon?", "lq.qPhase": "What is the Moon's phase?",
      "lq.qPhase1": "What is the", "lq.qPhase2": "Moon's phase?",
      "lq.chooser": "Question Chooser", "lq.appearance": "Moon's Appearance",
